<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_5xKerLzc3bBv4eZp2ASMZFarhonv" lang="en" class="geist_a71539c9-module__T19VSG__variable geist_mono_8d43a2aa-module__8Li5zG__variable h-full antialiased"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.1v5bejj26fx9h.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.0zr6hhvz-h9nw.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1_0pj6oq1lyhh.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2y7bagck-zv5-.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/17_-z7gjt27nv.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1x6-h-db6pkp9.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2c96bxpf6b0wu.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-0f25j6mof9kb4.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/37_1oeq6e75ki.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/455sb5e0fgpzb.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/26b56mnehcefn.js" async=""></script><title>Terms of Service — PropLine</title><meta name="description" content="Terms governing use of the PropLine API: acceptable use, redistribution, watermarking, API key security, and termination."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://prop-line.com/terms"/><meta property="og:title" content="PropLine — Player Props API with Graded Results"/><meta property="og:description" content="Every prop graded against the real box score — the thing other odds APIs don&#x27;t do. Real-time lines, cross-book +EV, and webhooks across 73 sports."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://prop-line.com"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="PropLine"/><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"/><meta property="og:image" content="https://prop-line.com/opengraph-image?3a4437923f09c74d"/><meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"/><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"/><meta property="og:image:alt" content="PropLine — player props API with results graded against the real box score"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:site" content="@proplinebets"/><meta name="twitter:creator" content="@proplinebets"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="PropLine — Player Props API with Graded Results"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Every prop graded against the real box score — won, lost, or push. Real-time lines, cross-book +EV, and webhooks."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://prop-line.com/opengraph-image?3a4437923f09c74d"/><meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="PropLine — player props API with results graded against the real box score"/><meta name="twitter:image:type" content="image/png"/><meta name="twitter:image:width" content="1200"/><meta name="twitter:image:height" content="630"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?favicon.0wcv1z8n04fqo.ico" sizes="16x16" type="image/x-icon"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0c0hxoamwjsbw.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="min-h-full flex flex-col"><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><nav class="border-b border-[var(--card-border)] bg-[var(--background)]/80 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between"><a class="flex items-center gap-2" href="/"><div class="w-8 h-8 bg-[var(--accent)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-black text-sm">PL</div><span class="text-lg font-semibold">PropLine</span></a><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><a class="text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm" href="/docs">Docs</a><a class="text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm" href="/ev">+EV</a><a class="text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm" href="/today">Results</a><a class="text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm" href="/freshness">Freshness</a><a class="text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm" href="/status">Status</a><a class="text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm" href="/pricing">Pricing</a><a class="text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors text-sm" href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a><a class="bg-[var(--accent)] hover:bg-[var(--accent-hover)] text-black font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm transition-colors" href="/#get-started">Get API Key</a></div></div></nav><main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16"><h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Terms of Service</h1><p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mb-12">Effective 2026-04-27. By creating an API key or calling the PropLine API you agree to these terms.</p><section id="acceptable-use" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">1. Acceptable use</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p>PropLine grants you a non-exclusive, non-transferable right to call the PropLine API for your own internal use, including building applications, models, websites, bots, and tools that consume our data. You may surface PropLine-derived insights (a single odds value, a prop result, a +EV figure) inside your own product.</p><p>You may not use the API to (a) attempt to circumvent rate limits or tier caps, (b) probe for vulnerabilities without prior written consent, (c) operate any service whose primary purpose is to mirror or redistribute our data, or (d) violate any applicable law.</p></div></section><section id="redistribution" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">2. Redistribution and resale</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p><strong class="text-white">Bulk redistribution of PropLine data is prohibited.</strong> <!-- -->Specifically, you may not resell, sublicense, publish as a dataset, or share with third parties any substantial portion of the data returned by the API — including, without limitation, exports from<code class="bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs mx-1">/v1/exports/resolved-props</code>, historical line-movement snapshots, and aggregated odds dumps.</p><p>Surfacing individual values inside an end-user product is fine. Repackaging the corpus for other developers, sportsbook operators, or data brokers is not. If you want a redistribution arrangement, contact us at<!-- --> <a href="mailto:support@prop-line.com" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline">support@prop-line.com</a> <!-- -->for an Enterprise license.</p></div></section><section id="watermarking" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">3. Watermarking and audit trail</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p>Bulk export CSVs include a<!-- --> <code class="bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">customer_token</code> <!-- -->column derived from the API key that downloaded them. The token is stable per customer — every export you ever pull carries the same value. We log every export call with the calling key, sport, and time window. If a leaked PropLine dataset surfaces, we can match its watermark or content fingerprint against our audit logs to identify the source.</p><p>Every export also includes a small number of synthetic<!-- --> <strong class="text-white">canary rows</strong>, marked with the literal prefix<!-- --> <code class="bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">(Watermark)</code> <!-- -->in the team and player-name fields. Canary rows are deterministically keyed to the API key that downloaded the export — independent of the<code class="bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs mx-1">customer_token</code> <!-- -->column — so a leaked CSV remains attributable even if the column is stripped. Honest customers can filter them out with<code class="bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs mx-1">WHERE player_name NOT LIKE &#x27;(Watermark)%&#x27;</code>; they will not affect any aggregate statistic that excludes them.</p><p>We disclose these mechanisms so you know they exist. Removing, modifying, or attempting to filter the watermark column or canary rows from data you redistribute does not affect your obligations under section 2 — it strengthens any claim under section 5.</p></div></section><section id="api-keys" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">4. API key security</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p>Each API key belongs to a single customer or account. You are responsible for keeping your key confidential and for all calls made with it, authorized or not. Sharing a key across companies, committing it to a public repository, or embedding it client-side in a way that exposes it to end users is your responsibility — if it leaks and a third party drains your tier, you remain on the hook.</p><p>If you suspect a key has been compromised, rotate it immediately via the<!-- --> <a class="text-[var(--accent)] underline" href="/dashboard">dashboard</a> <!-- -->and notify us.</p></div></section><section id="termination" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">5. Termination</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p>We may suspend or terminate your access at any time for breach of these terms — particularly violations of sections 1, 2, or 4. Material breaches do not entitle you to a refund of any prepaid fees for the current billing period.</p><p>You may cancel at any time via the Stripe Customer Portal linked from your dashboard. Cancellation takes effect at the end of your current billing period.</p></div></section><section id="warranty" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">6. No warranty; limitation of liability</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p>The API is provided <strong>as is</strong>. PropLine makes no representation that prices, lines, resolutions, or stats are free of error or suitable for any particular purpose, including any betting strategy. You assume all risk for actions you take based on PropLine data.</p><p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, PropLine&#x27;s aggregate liability for any claim arising from or related to the API is limited to the fees you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim.</p></div></section><section id="changes" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">7. Changes to these terms</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p>We may update these terms; the &quot;Effective&quot; date at the top reflects the current version. Continued use of the API after the effective date of an update constitutes acceptance. Material changes (anything affecting redistribution, refunds, or termination) will be emailed to active customers at least 14 days before they take effect.</p></div></section><section id="contact" class="mb-12"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]">8. Contact</h2><div class="space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed"><p>Questions about these terms or licensing inquiries:<!-- --> <a href="mailto:support@prop-line.com" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline">support@prop-line.com</a>.</p></div></section></main><footer class="border-t border-[var(--card-border)] py-12 px-6 mt-auto"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="w-6 h-6 bg-[var(--accent)] rounded flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-black text-xs">PL</div><span class="text-sm font-medium">PropLine</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-[var(--muted)] flex-wrap justify-center"><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/docs">Documentation</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/developers">Developers</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/recipes">Recipes</a><a href="https://api.prop-line.com/docs" target="_blank" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">API Reference</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/ev">+EV plays</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/sportsbook-webhook-api">Webhook API</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/discord-webhooks">Discord webhooks</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/prop-resolution-api">Prop resolution</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/cheapest-player-props-api">Pricing comparison</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/odds-api">Markets A–Z</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/odds-api/book">Odds API by sportsbook</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/for-ai-agents">For AI agents</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/world-cup-odds-api">World Cup odds API</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/tennis-odds-api">Tennis odds API</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/trends">Player trends</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/sharp-odds-api">Sharp odds API</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/pinnacle-closing-odds-api">Closing odds (CLV)</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/sportsbook-accuracy">Book accuracy</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/google-sheets">Google Sheets</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/prediction-markets-vs-sportsbooks">Exchanges vs books</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/betting-exchange-api">Exchange API</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/historical-backfill?from=footer">Historical Backfill</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/switch-from-the-odds-api">Switch from the-odds-api</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/the-odds-api-vs-propline">vs the-odds-api</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/draftkings-api-alternative">DraftKings API</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/about">About</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/contact">Contact</a><a href="mailto:support@prop-line.com" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Support</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/status">Status</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/freshness">Freshness</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/api-versioning">API versioning</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/changelog">Changelog</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/terms">Terms</a><a class="hover:text-white transition-colors" href="/privacy">Privacy</a></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4"><div class="sf-root" data-id="4095982" data-badge="dark-default" data-variant-id="sf" style="width:125px"><a href="https://sourceforge.net/software/product/PropLine/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)] hover:text-white transition-colors">PropLine Reviews</a></div><p class="text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> PropLine. All rights reserved.</p></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2y7bagck-zv5-.js" id="_R_" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[58632,[\"/_next/static/immutable/chunks/37_1oeq6e75ki.js\"],\"default\