\",null,{\"children\":[\"Every export also includes a small number of synthetic\",\" \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white\",\"children\":\"canary rows\"}],\", marked with the literal prefix\",\" \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs\",\"children\":\"(Watermark)\"}],\" \",\"in the team and player-name fields. Canary rows are deterministically keyed to the API key that downloaded the export — independent of the\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs mx-1\",\"children\":\"customer_token\"}],\" \",\"column — so a leaked CSV remains attributable even if the column is stripped. Honest customers can filter them out with\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--card-bg)] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs mx-1\",\"children\":\"WHERE player_name NOT LIKE '(Watermark)%'\"}],\"; they will not affect any aggregate statistic that excludes them.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We disclose these mechanisms so you know they exist. Removing, modifying, or attempting to filter the watermark column or canary rows from data you redistribute does not affect your obligations under section 2 — it strengthens any claim under section 5.\"}]]}]]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"api-keys\",\"className\":\"mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-[var(--card-border)]\",\"children\":\"4. API key security\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4 text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Each API key belongs to a single customer or account. You are responsible for keeping your key confidential and for all calls made with it, authorized or not. Sharing a key across companies, committing it to a public repository, or embedding it client-side in a way that exposes it to end users is your responsibility — if it leaks and a third party drains your tie